    },
    "primitive": "At EACH v choose Phi_v,mu=r_v (I_orb tensor g_v) Gamma_mu (I_orb tensor g_vdag), r_v>0, independent g_v in Spin3. Gamma0=X_orb tensor I; Gamma_i=Z_orb tensor sigma_i. Primitive 4CAR/site has orbital2 times internal-right2, all16 states. Phi norm sum_mu tr(Phi_mu\u00b2)=16r_v\u00b2. This ordered constitutive orbit, primitive CAR/statistics, physical left action and RIGHT gauging are assumptions, not emergent Nature facts.",
    "metric": "Product selected-orbit trace metric: M_rad=16M_matrix, I_v(r_v)=M_rad r_v\u00b2/2. Quantization CHOSEN as minimal Laplace-Beltrami before independent RIGHT Gauss reduction. Each physical cone retains r_v\u00b3dr_v normalized Haar. u_v=r_v^(3/2)f_v gives -d\u00b2/(2M_rad)+[3/8+S_v\u00b2]/(M_rad r_v\u00b2). No S_total\u00b2 substituted, no double counting of primitive spin, no fitted centrifugal term or inserted particle mass. radial_mass names a matrix-field metric coefficient, not measured carrier mass.",
    "product_right": "I psi(g0,g1,g2)=prod_v U_F,v(g_v)^dag psi. Product Haar proves I\u2020I=I; local RIGHT constraint R_v+T_CAR,v=0. Physical LEFT differentiation of actual coordinate g_w pulls back to S_w only; all three are independent before reduction. Centres g_v->-g_v sew by (-1)^N_v. Local j=0,1/2,1 exhaust full16CAR; no positive-band, one-pair, global-spin or source-family projection.",
    "raw_operator_provenance": "Pure raw_frame() constructs normalized PW j0+1/2+1=14 times primitive16=224, exact D(g)c_right contraction with epsilon and CG, solves RIGHT Gauss, and generates its full16 occupation basis. It returns raw P, LEFT and sources. Owning architecture recomputes these fresh, measures Gram/Gauss/CAR, and obtains each4x4 one-root physical LEFT action by restricting those actual pulled-back derivatives. Gamma_i uses twice that measured action and a disclosed orbitalZ constitutive choice; Gamma0 orbitalX anticommutes. This is not copying a fixed free Dirac Hamiltonian or interpreting auxiliary orbital as physical spin.",
    "root_and_branches": "Actual H_root=sum_v g_root r_v d_vdag Gamma0 d_v. Its instantaneous eigenvalues \u00b1g_root r_v are both in the owning operator, and full quantum r_v changes them. Negative orbital occupancy is prepared2/site but evolves with interband vector transports. Signed source addition/removal brightness is never normalized away; removal is hole, not positron proof. Positive r orbit is a chosen ordered cone, not both sign-r vacua; both signed root-energy orbitals and both charge branches remain.",
    "relative_frames": "Before reduction invariant edge C_jdag g_jdag [t I + i v Z_orb tensor sigma\u00b7(R n_ij)] g_i C_i U_ij, times (r_i+r_j)/2. g_i,g_j are independent physical frames, so the intermediate endpoint sewing is not a global frame density assignment. Reduction gives actual source bilinears d_jdag [...] d_i. Different triangle tangents do not commute in root LEFT action. The centred bond amplitude is an explicit constitutive choice. Whole relative-frame, r, material-R and literal charge-link products formed BEFORE finite material projection. R is actual SO3 l0+alll1 Haar basis, no pinned spin axis.",
    "Gauss": "3 oriented edges0->1->2->0, incidence B=[(1,0,-1),(-1,1,0),(0,-1,1)]. E_e=-2..2; ions2/site, Q_v=2-n_v; B E+(6-N,0,0)=Q. Retain every fixedN mask and every electric solution. H_E=(sum E\u00b2+(6-N)\u00b2)/(2 I_E) and centred charge cost k/2 sum(2-n_v)\u00b2. Every forward d_jdag d_i raises E_ij by1 BEFORE projection. No illegal bare U=I hopping, old ions1 or old chemical potential extension. Finite boundary Wilson source to sitev raises tree E0..v-1 for addition and lowers for removal.",
    "fields": "Three independent r_v fields (product3\u00b3), actual E links, quantum material R. H has no inserted Maxwell B or magnetic oscillator. W raises all3 cycle electric integers, F=(W-Wdag)/(2i) is actual finite Wilson sine, NOT physical B. No additional SU3/internal-colour loop is chosen in this electron prototype; it does not drop one from a reused law. E and Wilson fields react to full charge dynamics. Radial dynamics and H_root/transport/frame coupling yield genuine quantum feedback.",
    "current": "Physical charge q=-1: H(A)=H_static-sum_e[e^(-iA_e)T_e+h.c.]. Current J_e=-dH/dA_e=-i(T_e-T_edag), contact=d\u00b2H/dA_e\u00b2=T_e+T_edag. With Q=2-n, dQ/dt+B J=0 and dE/dt=-J. This is material-link charge flow, not free COM or full3D EM. Own variants must supply their own H/current/contact/energy/power.",
    "Noether": "J_total=sum_v S_v+L_material generates simultaneous physical rotations of all g_v and material vertices/bonds; U1 links are scalar edge variables and add no invented field angular momentum. Local S_v from physical LEFT_v is not separately conserved by transport. Scalar route can TRANSPORT local spin even with total frame torque0. Norm r_v\u00b2 is local matrix amplitude, not spatial radius. Signed excess Q/S/r\u00b2 and correlations are not positive particle PVMs; count and localspin joint PVMs are available.",
    "regulator": "Uniform positive interior u grid with Dirichlet outer walls and omitted origin: local3 nodes .55,1,1.45. Correct inherited3/8 and localS\u00b2 potential retained; this is a finite difference regulator, not radial continuum convergence. Material all l0+l1 is a declared finite angular regulator; no closure of omitted l>=2 claimed. Ecap2 physical source/link truncation retained and shell weight reported. No new general engine.",
    "prepared_reference": "NEW owning neutral INPUT: local negative-root double occupied singlet at EACH of3sites; coherent Ecycle=-1,0,1 amplitudes .5,1,.5; product actual isolated-negative-filled-root radial ground and materiall0. It is honestly prepared and generally NONSTATIONARY under full interacting H. Every charged trajectory compares to actual absolute-time neutral evolution under its OWN variant. No old eigenstate/result imported, independent consumer shares this input rather than claiming independent ground solve.",
    "controls": "same-state path_cut removes edges0,2 isolating source site0; retains edge1 and all fields/root. vector_off removes ONLY noncommuting vector transport; scalar transfer remains so local spin transport is allowed. all_hop_off freezes every count but not local norm/root/matrix dynamics. Field-only exp(i alpha E0) commutes all count/spin/r\u00b2 at t0 and modifies full charge-link motion thereafter. Frozen-field trajectory is not substituted.",
    "scope": "Finite conditional rich local candidate and executed response/falsification only. No global vacuum/N-uniform theorem, electron admission, measured positron, selfbinding/freeCOM/Lorentz/Maxwell/Nature/proton/massless3Dphoton claim. Source preparedness and finite co-motion are weaker than unique autonomous particle. Parent alone integrates/governs."
